      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-15498",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following could be the graph of a function $f(x)$ that satisfies the conditions below?\n\n- $f^{\u2032}(-1) = 0$\n- $f^{\u2033}(x) > 0$ for all $x \u2208 (- \u221e, \u221e)$\n- if $x \u2208 (- \u221e,-1)$ then $f^{\u2032}(x) < 0$\n- if $x \u2208 (-1, \u221e)$ then $f^{\u2032}(x) > 0$"
